# tally 2.2 (CHANGES.md 2.2-9), L §2.3 askbody, §5.18: `explain low(…)` is cut; a lowest balance is explained in two
# asks, its day by `argmin(…) ties by d` and then `explain bal(x, <that day>) from t`.
=== m.tally
